<p>Also, sidenote, Draven Kondraki belongs to <a href="http://v1als.tumblr.com/">V1als on tumblr</a>. He is not to be blamed for this although he IS in the offending discord.</p>
<p>EDIT 5/01/2018: Friendly reminder that I got my <a href="http://photosynthi.tumblr.com/post/173039162753/fucking-dumb-bitch-sick-of-your-smut-shit-being">first ever internet hate mail</a> and my first ever <a href="http://photosynthi.tumblr.com/post/173079016098/even-if-you-get-it-to-be-high-rated-youll-still">genuine, actual death threat</a> over this tale about kondraki getting his dick stuck in a water bottle. Like I'm not even really that mad, I just cannot believe, still, a month after receiving them, that this made someone furious enough to STORM into my inbox DEMANDING to know why, WHY I would write such MORTIFYING, such INFALLIBLE content as dickbottle kondraki. My bitch was so <em>beside themselves</em> with fury that they came offsite to personally confront me not once but <em>twice</em>. Can you imagine being that person? Could you imagine just <em>seething</em> with rage over this tale? Like there is at least one (1) person out there in the world ready to meet me in the parking lot over dickbottle kondraki and I'm still reeling</p>

